{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46218","headline":"陪冯使君游六首 过相思岭 · 贯休","name":"陪冯使君游六首 过相思岭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"誉自馨香道自怡，相思岭上却无机。\n荒蕖叶覆深霞在，片石人吟一鸟飞。\n何处风砧传古曲，谁家冢树挂斜晖。\n因思往事真堪笑，鹤背渔竿未是归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}